  "desc": "Dirt-samples speech shattered into grains by chop and striate, slowed and drowned in room and dub delay into an atmospheric, blurred vocal cloud. Sparse drifts one chopped voice through a slow filter breath; full layers a half-speed reversed striated bed beneath a denser grain stream; peak stacks three chopped/sliced/reversed voices into a wide swirling wash with periodic phrase reversals. A human voice dissolved into weather. Non-pitched, drifting, meditative.",
